                "text": "The answer is clear: Reopen the government, save hospitals, stop healthcare premium price hikes. If Speaker Johnson doesn\u2019t bring Congressional Republicans back, our healthcare system nationwide will crumble under soaring costs and strain \u2014 and every American will feel the impact.",
