                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "I was in Washington again to do my job \u2014 to fight for families who are seeing their health care premiums skyrocket and reopen the government. It\u2019s time for Speaker Johnson to bring Congressional Republicans back to open the House and get back to work for the American people. https://t.co/FljDtbCwGB",
