                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "As a State Senator I passed the first bill in the nation opening the door for telehealth legislation nation wide. My federal legislation to expand telehealth coverage passed in 2021 with strong bipartisan support. We need to bring Congress back to extend those telehealth services so that all Americans can have access to care.",
