                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Rising health care premiums will hit independent contractors and small business owners especially hard. Congressional Republicans are driving up costs and undermining Americans\u2019 ability to stay insured and save for their future. https://t.co/xQ2eCmb8gG",
